Package: tlgagent
Title: Clinical Trials Agent
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Description: A publicly available example of a commons self-service data
    agent for clinical trials. It answers questions about a simulated clinical
    study by running trusted Tables, Listings, and Graphs recipes adapted from
    insightsengineering/tlg-catalog and governed SQL over synthetic CDISC ADaM
    data from random.cdisc.data.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
